# The importer, which does not import c, defines the inline 🧷, whose body calls the struct-by-value trampoline
# which the package's archive provides.
@ ^ffiPackagePackage\.class_1f9ee\.1f9f7
# The package's C functions are not linked again into the importer: they are only declared.
! ^ffiPackageAdd$
! ^ffiPackageIncrement$
